## Incremental Verification

**After each task (not just at the end)**:

### TypeScript Check (Modified Files Only)

```bash
# Check specific files
npx tsc --noEmit path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts

# Or full typecheck if many files
npm run typecheck
```

### Lint Check (Modified Files Only)

```bash
# Check specific files
npx eslint path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts

# Or full lint
npm run lint
```

### Build Check (After All Tasks)

```bash
npm run build
```

