## Success Metrics

✅ All tasks executed via sequential subagent dispatch
✅ Handoff payloads passed between tasks
✅ All verification commands pass
✅ Implementation matches plan acceptance criteria
✅ Sources cited for complex implementations
✅ Git checkpoint created (if complex feature)
✅ No security red flags

❌ Tasks executed in main context (no subagents)
❌ Handoff payloads missing or invalid
❌ Code committed without verification
❌ Verification failures ignored
❌ Plan acceptance criteria not met
❌ Blocked tasks skipped
❌ Tasks executed in parallel (sequential-only enforced)
